# Rendered machine configs and talosconfig. These carry the cluster PKI in
# plaintext and are build artifacts, never committed -- the source of truth is
# talenv.yaml, talsecret.sops.yaml, patches/ and nodes/.
#
# Ignore everything rather than listing filenames: talhelper used to rewrite
# this file on every genconfig, so a node added after the switch would
# otherwise have leaked its config into git.
*
!.gitignore
